      "statement": "NewClient in utils/cautils/client.go centralizes online/offline selection: with the offline flag it requires ca-config and returns NewOfflineCA; otherwise it resolves ca-url via flags.ParseCaURL, defaults root to pki.GetRootCAPath(), and returns the online client ca.NewClient from smallstep/certificates.",
