    {
      "id": "claim_b564b2810aee41cdbe0bffa50b8c5a65",
      "statement": "OfflineCA in utils/cautils/offline.go wraps authority.Authority from smallstep/certificates: NewOfflineCA is a process-wide singleton that loads a CA configuration file (JSON config.Config) and calls authority.New(&cfg); Sign delegates to authority.Authorize plus authority.SignWithContext and Renew to authority.Renew, so offline issuance runs in-process with the same client interface as online mode.",
